
# SQL Stakeholder Dashboards — Task 3

Two audience-specific analytics products built in Metabase on the `ecom`
database: a **Leadership Snapshot** (required, founder-facing business
health) and a **Product Dashboard** (role-specific, PM-facing user
behavior). Each has its own PRD with a real stakeholder interview, an
explicit list of excluded metrics, and a defended design.

